{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07486","headline":"登松江驿楼北望故园 · 刘长卿","name":"登松江驿楼北望故园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泪尽江楼北望归，田园已陷百重围。\n平芜万里无人去，落日千山空鸟飞。\n孤舟漾漾寒潮小，极浦苍苍远树微。\n白鸥渔父徒相待，未扫欃枪嬾息机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}